10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[15px] font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 min-[360px]:text-base sm:text-2xl\">GreenEngineering<span class=\"text-emerald-600\">LCA</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-5 lg:flex xl:gap-6\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/\">The Engine</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/guides\">Guides</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md transition-colors hover:bg-slate-800\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Launch Workspace</a></div><div class=\"lg:hidden shrink-0\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation-panel\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-emerald-700 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main class=\"w-full min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-clip\"><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50\"><section class=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-20\"><p class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-300\">Engineering knowledge base</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight\">Embodied Carbon &amp; Building LCA Guides</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">Practical, calculation-focused explanations that support the Green Engineering Tools LCA calculator. Each guide answers a different engineering question instead of repeating the same SEO text across multiple pages.</p><a class=\"mt-7 inline-flex rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white hover:bg-emerald-400\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Open calculator</a></div></section><section class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/methodology\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">Building LCA Methodology</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">How the calculation handles units, modules, replacements, transport and missing data.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">Embodied Carbon Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">A practical guide to calculating construction material carbon from CSV or BIM quantities.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/a1-a3-embodied-carbon\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">A1-A3 Embodied Carbon</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Product-stage GWP, declared units and fair EPD comparisons.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">EPD Carbon Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">How to read Environmental Product Declarations and use them in calculations.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/ec3-epd-guide\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">EC3 EPD Guide</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Search, correct BIM names, select EPDs and understand EC3&#x27;s role in LCA.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/bim-embodied-carbon\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">BIM Embodied Carbon</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Revit and BIM schedule workflows, quantity QA and live synchronization.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/whole-building-lca\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">Whole-Building LCA</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Scope, service life, lifecycle stages, impact categories and baseline comparison.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/module-d-lca\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">Module D Explained</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Reuse and recycling beyond the system boundary without double counting.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/leed-whole-building-lca\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">LEED Whole-Building LCA</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Version-aware guidance for LEED v4, v4.1 and v5.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a></div><div class=\"mt-14 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\">Suggested learning path</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-700 leading-7\">If you are new to embodied carbon, start with the calculator guide, then read A1-A3 and the EPD guide. If you work with Revit or material schedules, continue to the BIM and EC3 guides. For certification or whole-life studies, finish with the methodology, whole-building LCA, Module D and LEED guides.</p></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto w-full border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-2 sm:text-left lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"mr-2 h-7 w-7 shrink-0 text-emerald-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-black tracking-tight text-white\">GreenEngineering Tools</span></a><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400 sm:mx-0\">Browser-based tools and practical guides for embodied carbon, EPD data, BIM material workflows and whole-building life-cycle assessment.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Open LCA calculator →</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Tools</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer tools navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">LCA Engine</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator/actual-data\">Actual / Complex Goods</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator/electricity\">CBAM Electricity</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator/bulk\">Official Bulk CSV</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Learn</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer learning navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\">Embodied Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/a1-a3-embodied-carbon\">A1-A3 Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\">EPD Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/ec3-epd-guide\">EC3 EPD Guide</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">More Guides</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer additional guides\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/bim-embodied-carbon\">BIM Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/whole-building-lca\">Whole-Building LCA</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/module-d-lca\">Module D Explained</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/leed-whole-building-lca\">LEED Whole-Building LCA</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Company</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer company navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/terms-of-service\">Terms of Service</a></nav></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-800 pt-7 md:flex-row\"><p class=\"text-center text-xs text-slate-500 md:text-left\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Green Engineering Tools. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-center text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500 md:text-right\">Engineering decision-support tools for EN 15804-aligned lifecycle analysis and LEED whole-building LCA workflows. Formal certification and compliance remain subject to project-specific requirements and independent review.</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[89759,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nd:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1icgbrcdew2yz.js\\\"],\\\"d